<title>FRANCE: French crude steel output fell in August.</title>
<headline>French crude steel output fell in August.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>French crude steel production fell six percent to 1.207 million tonnes in August 1996 from the same month for 1995, statistics from the French steel federation showed.</p>
<p>Production had risen by 1.4 percent to 1.592 million tonnes in July 1996 over July 1995.</p>
<p>Total output for the first eight months of 1996 was down 7.9 percent to 11.485 million tonnes over the same period for 1995.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
